  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China Climate and Energy Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China is the world&#x2019;s largest emitter of greenhouse gases and this programme aims is to mainstream and advance solar and wind power in China&#x2019;s electricity mix, by:
&#x2022; Addressing the political and infrastructural barriers that constrain solar and wind energy penetration in the electric power system at the national and provincial level; and
&#x2022; Mobilising China&#x2019;s business community and financial institutions to pilot green energy procurement and installations and enhance their climate risk disclosure.</narrative>
  </description>
